{
  "name": "interaction-sweep-orbit",
  "note": "ORBIT-mode clips. Desktop coords assume 1200x900 (canvas centre ~600,470); phone coords assume 390x844 (centre ~195,420). `arms` restricts a clip to specific arms.",
